== 2. c2: what the knee needs, per replicate, against what each allowance supplies (Bulk q = 0.10) ==
  need = Tmin(W95) - F_c. Shipped supply A0 = sig + q*l_c. Each family's free constant, solved so that D = 0, is printed: a value solved this way is a FIT, not a provenance.
